  "keyFeatures": [
    "Automatic commit message suggestions derived from your diff — no AI, no network calls",
    "Built-in secret detection blocks commits containing leaked keys or tokens",
    "Atomic release workflow with rollback across GitHub, GitLab, Gitea, and Forgejo",
    "Sync command with auto-recovery for common push/pull failures",
    "Interactive branch management: create, switch, delete with merge-safety checks",
    "Pull request creation and review from the terminal",
    "Full commit history secret scanner",
    "Zero telemetry — config never leaves your machine"
  ],
